NFS: More O_DIRECT accounting fixes for error paths

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.117.1.el8_10
commit-author Trond Myklebust <trond.myklebust@hammerspace.com>
commit 8982f7aff39fb526aba4441fff2525fcedd5e1a3
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.117.1.el8_10/8982f7af.failed

If we hit a fatal error when retransmitting, we do need to record the
removal of the request from the count of written bytes.

Fixes: 031d73ed768a ("NFS: Fix O_DIRECT accounting of number of bytes read/written")
	Signed-off-by: Trond Myklebust <trond.myklebust@hammerspace.com>
	Signed-off-by: Anna Schumaker <Anna.Schumaker@Netapp.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8982f7aff39fb526aba4441fff2525fcedd5e1a3)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

